  "body": "## Summary\n- Stage one exact-edition Quarriors! base-game evidence packet for the rotating dice-pool-building wishlist focus.\n- Scope is WizKids product 70939 / BGG 91536; expansions, Dice Masters, and bundled editions are excluded.\n- Include official product/rulebook receipts, two independent reviews, claim-level provenance, and four source-linked visual derivatives.\n\n## Evidence boundary\n- Official WizKids product page: https://wizkids.com/quarriors/\n- Official English rulebook URL: https://wizkidsgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/Quarriors-Rulebook-70939.pdf\n- Exact rulebook recovered through 2013 archive capture: https://web.archive.org/web/20130812130122id_/http://wizkidsgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/Quarriors-Rulebook-70939.pdf\n- Independent reviews: https://tabletopbellhop.com/game-reviews/quarriors/ and https://www.meeplemountain.com/reviews/quarriors/\n\n## Validation\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --run 2026-08-06-quarriors`\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --base origin/main`\n- `node scripts/validate-okf.mjs`\n- intake/provenance regression suite: 46 passed, 1 skipped\n- `git diff --check`\n\nBathcat stops here. No approval, promotion, canonical games write, or merge is included.",
  "closed_at": "2026-08-08T01:14:25Z",
